# market data - regenerable, and 66 GB of it. Under data/ we track only the
# source (*.py *.awk *.sh *.ipynb *.html) and the notes (*.md); everything else
# IS the data. Raw bars: src/data/fetch_alpaca.py (v1.0-v2.1), JYDB pull via
# data/01-pkl层/一次排查/check_db/jydb.py (v3.0).
# Cleaned bars: src/data/prepare_v3_minute.py.
#
# *.txt matters most: the txt layer alone is 4,006 files / 59 GB. It used to sit
# outside data/ so nothing caught it; after the 2026-08 reorg it lives at
# data/02-txt层/原始数据/ and `git add -A` will happily try to stage all of it.
data/**/*.txt
data/**/*.pkl
data/**/*.parquet
data/**/*.csv
# report/ is the opposite: its 明细/*.csv ARE the deliverable (11 MB total), tracked.

.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store

# Obsidian: 每次开图/切窗口都会改，diff 全是噪声。
# graph.json / core-plugins.json 保留在版本里，图谱设置是共享的。
obsidian/.obsidian/workspace.json

